  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&apos;KIZ LAKE IRRIGATION PROJECT (F.S)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE R&apos;KIZ LAKE IS LOCATED AT 40 KM FROM SOUTH BANK OF THE SENEGAL RIVER WITH A LENGTH OF 30 KM AND AN AVERAGE WIDTH OF 5KM. THE LAKE IS SUPPLIED WITH WATER BY THE FLOODS FROM SENEGAL RIVER. THE PROJECT AIMS AT DEVELOPING 1500 HA THROU IRRIGATION TO IMPROVE THE LIVING STANDARD OF THE FARMERS IN THE AREA AND TO ATTAIN FOOD SELF_SUFFICIENCY.</narrative>
  </description>
